    "title": "Central Tech EMT students graduate - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Long Caption Central Tech recognized its graduating EMT class at the Drumright campus on Thursday, December 18. Graduates will now prepare for the National Registry of Emergency Medical Technicians (NREMT) exam as they begin their service as emergency responders. Back row (from left: Kyle Covington, Tulsa; Angus Ponder, Bristow; Emmitt Myers, Tulsa; Caden Newfield, Tulsa; Warrick Petit, Broken Arrow; Hunter Meadows, Mannford; Grayson Perceful, Davenport. Front row from left Skyler Fick, Tryon; Mason Harvey, Mannford; Ashton Irving, Cleveland; Jaxon Mach, Bristow; Kaden Johnson, Chandler; Ashton Turpin, Tryon; Rilee Buchanan, Sand Springs. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
